      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Euh... As PC user, you can enter Quest worlds. Quest cannot enter PC world. That is already there set.\nSame for avatars. PC can use both avatar versions, but Quest cannot use PC avatars and will not see other pc avatars.\nThe VRChat home world as starting place is already made for Quest and PC. But if you have already set other world, you need fix it yourself.\nJust look at the icons when checking worlds. It will tell it's Quest optimized world or not.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
