      "value": "@{5bad5c3ff0fbe557387ab6f2|full_name}: There is no world that has BOTH modes. It's always Quest world (exported from Unity with Android pack) or always PC world.\nThere is no mixed Quest / PC world in VRChat. It's not possible now and there are no tools for it to switch.\nQuest worlds are optimized for Quest, but you can enter Quest worlds without problem as PC user.",
