      "value": "@{5bcbaf75fab2337b72ced6b0|full_name}: Yes, I understand that. The point of the post is to allow for the PC player to see the Quest version of the world/avatar instead for a more optimized version. An example of this would be the Black Cat. In the Quest version, the magazine stands, light fixtures, potted plants, and other miscellaneous objects are removed\n\"It's not possible now and there are no tools for it to switch.\"\nExactly, which is why I'm recommending it on here.",
      "viewerReactions": null
